<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue between Viv Ansanm gangs and Haitian security forces, now reinforced by a Kenya-led multinational mission patrolling Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff. The Dominican army has supplied large ammunition stocks to the 400 Mawozo gang, boosting its firepower, while the UN has allocated an extra US$75 million for Haiti and called for additional funding. Digicel service has suffered multiple outages, prompting criticism from Haitians. The UCDP recorded 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNZUQwWXpVMHR6Q1AxNFUwMGV5Rnc0XzhzN21LUDVWaUZQTEp3QUdtYVFIRy1FUFdJdXJTejA1V010UlBib004TEtjU1RWeXVNRHhCTmFRdndHQ1lsZzVYZEtZdXBDLUlINDVEbm1kQ2NkR05GTnB3R2toN1VJRFUtRVRFWi1XXy02d1FBRElzak5tYTFnZWJVMDBEVDMyY3ZnMXBSNW90OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1PSDNZYklwbFlURFR4ZWw5TXBzM2kxUUV5SEZfZHFESFdkUVU2Q2tKUHZJSzBNeFNGZmlfTUQtb0pzaFJZNllRRjNMajF1RkJBdkNkcGF4aHVabFF4TzNteUhEQWVsazkxMnhJeFdSZVZfekluWW8xZjJSX2VYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQaXRJSGRBbVVpTU9FMHA0SG5HcThvRkdrQmRCNGNEbEZTcjAzdldYblJtRGdtX2M3SFUzREluZDUxWDQzZURkVlJfYlNETUxTREo1Y0t3R1FBVWtPMl9RNWdPanJuX09YZG9LN1VJdExpYmduT1BiOS1PcUtsRUo3ZHJ1TnFhZ0l6REpzUUw0UUdjeW1LMnRzZHJYTWVBZ2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNdTlyQ1BUa0RIYWc1NXJPbzhXWC13d0toaldRT3pYeHBVdmlSekc1Vm0xenI4NS1JUHNnbTFZUkFISFZ5bnhpMGxNdGxfSDg2MzJacEdOMG9CbTd6OEpkUkx2cUtaN2VxckUzdkEwV21hR25CUml2LWx1MjR3NmRwYU4zZG5DZ3FfR1d2blZvWHdwNXVGRE9iV0tBVUtnWXd4RDFFd0pLcXVyd0RGMTVuU0gxWFoySWpi?oc=5&quot;&gt;News From The States